      "id": 14644583,
      "title": "[2/2] net/sched: sch_multiq: Replace direct dequeue call with peek and qdisc_dequeue_peeked",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-2-85c40b83c529@proton.me",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-2-85c40b83c529@proton.me/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-2-85c40b83c529@proton.me/mbox/",
      "hash": "99e662f8090a76f4461573b14a438ca7f36880f7",
      "commitRef": "54f6b0c843e228d499eb4b6bbb89df68cad9ad5d",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Bryam Vargas",
      "date": "2026-06-25T09:51:20",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 sch_multiq qdisc 中的一个严重 bug。原 multiq_dequeue() 在调用 multiq_peek() 之后直接调用子 qdisc 的 ->dequeue() 取出报文。当子 qdisc 是非 work-conserving 类型时，peek 操作会将 skb 暂存在子 qdisc 的 gso_skb 中，直接 dequeue 会返回不同的 skb，导致 gso_skb 被孤立，使子 qdisc 的 qlen/backlog 失同步。若该子 qdisc 是 qfq 并通过 peek 父 qdisc（如 tbf）访问，会在空链表上重入并解引用 NULL，在 softirq 中引发内核 panic。修复方法是将直接 dequeue 替换为 qdisc_dequeue_peeked() 辅助函数（与 sch_prio 一致），该辅助函数在子 qdisc 无 stash 时是 no-op，不影响 work-conserving 子 qdisc 的正常工作。",
      "tags": [
        "包处理",
        "性能",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14644584,
      "title": "[1/2] net/sched: sch_taprio: Replace direct dequeue call with peek and qdisc_dequeue_peeked",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-1-85c40b83c529@proton.me",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260625-b4-disp-31bcb279-v1-1-85c40b83c529@proton.me/",
