      "id": 14643466,
      "title": "[net,v3,04/11] afs: Fix further netns teardown to cancel the preallocation charger",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624163819.3017002-5-dhowells@redhat.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-5-dhowells@redhat.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624163819.3017002-5-dhowells@redhat.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "fcb0ebb4980b6b5de62d3e688a2c771473ad643b",
      "commitRef": "2daf8ac812c3d78c642fe7652f62e29df5e3da20",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "David Howells",
      "date": "2026-06-24T16:38:11",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 AFS 文件系统在网络命名空间（netns）拆除过程中的竞态条件。afs_close_socket() 先取消预分配 charger 工作项并减小 listen backlog 到零，但 I/O 线程处理中的 incoming call 可能在此窗口重新排队 charger 工作项。修复方法是在 kernel_listen(0) 之后再调用一次 cancel_work_sync() 取消该工作项，并配合 flush_workqueue 确保所有 async 工作项结束，从而防止 netns 拆除后仍有引用 AFS socket 的后台任务运行。涉及 netns 生命周期管理与 socket 关闭顺序的交互问题。",
      "tags": [
        "Linux内核网络",
        "Socket"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14643183,
      "title": "[V2,net,3/4] net: hns3: fix permanent link down deadlock after reset",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260624141319.271439-4-shaojijie@huawei.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624141319.271439-4-shaojijie@huawei.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260624141319.271439-4-shaojijie@huawei.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "3a276cd25682df0c636621da8a718742e3cc1f7c",
      "commitRef": "c711f6d1cee955e04d1cd1f76cd8abd024b27a72",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Jijie Shao",
      "date": "2026-06-24T14:13:18",
      "summary": "这是针对华为 HNS3 网络驱动（drivers/net/ethernet/hisilicon/hns3/）的修复，解决了在特定 ethtool 操作序列加硬件复位后网口永久 Link Down 的死锁问题。根本原因是：用户禁用 autoneg 并强制错误速率后重新开启 autoneg 时，netdev 将 cmd->base.speed 设为 SPEED_UNKNOWN（0xffffffff），驱动将其保存到 req_speed；在复位恢复过程中，MAC 初始化读取尚未同步的 autoneg 状态（仍为 OFF），误判为强制模式，将 SPEED_UNKNOWN 写入硬件寄存器导致 MAC 固件状态机冻结，而 PHY 已启用 autoneg，两者永久不匹配。修复方案：一是在 hclge_cfg_mac_speed_dup_h() 和相关路径中拦截 SPEED_UNKNOWN/DUPLEX_UNKNOWN，避免污染缓存配置；二是在 hclge_set_autoneg() 成功后将 req_autoneg 同步保存，保证复位恢复时能正确读取 autoneg 状态。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
